    schema:description "As a Content Marketing Manager you will own organic social as an always-on channel for the Scandinavian market, translating the global content and brand strategy into relevant local content. You will manage the local community in their own language and act as the fast, native-speaking point of contact for market-specific content needs, working within existing SEO and brand frameworks rather than building a parallel strategy. PERGOLUX designs and sells Scandinavian-inspired outdoor living products, such as pergolas and garden furniture, directly to customers. We are a premium e-commerce company with around 300 employees, 9-figure revenue, and operations across 8 markets, combining Nordic design with a clear focus on quality and customer experience. What You'll Do Turn the global content calendar and brand pillars into a market-specific plan aligned to local seasonality, holidays, and campaigns, and spot content gaps and opportunities. Own the daily organic social channels (Instagram, TikTok, and others): content creation, planning, and community management, adapting global assets to local tone and interacting with the community in the local language. Localise and adapt blog and on-site content from the global calendar, including cultural adaptation and light on-page SEO, and support blog refreshes. Act as the local-language quality check across all content types and the first point of contact for ad-hoc content needs, escalating to global Creative Ops when full production is required. Shape the influencer content plan, create briefings and timelines, track performance, and grow influencer outreach in the market, including repurposing creator/UGC content with credit and cleared rights. What You'll Bring 2–4 years in content marketing, organic social, or a hybrid content/social role, ideally in e-commerce or DTC. Native or near-native skills in a Scandinavian language, plus confident English for cross-team collaboration. Experience working within others' brand and SEO frameworks rather than setting strategy independently. Strong sense for short-form, social-first content plus solid long-form writing and editing, proven localisation experience (real adaptation, not just translation), and photo/video editing for fast social content. Nice to have: experience working with a central/global marketing function and familiarity with GA and native platform insights (Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn) for simple performance reporting. 💼 Compensation — Competitive salary · Company pension · Fully paid, capped overtime without endless unpaid crunch 🚀 Growth and Career Development — You will take real ownership of organic social and local content from day one and can grow into a senior role as influencer outreach expands and PERGOLUX scales further. ⏰ Time Off and Flexibility — Up to 30 vacation days, starting at 27 · One week of remote workation per year in the EU/UK 🌟 Benefits and Lifestyle Jobrad / bike leasing program for sustainable, healthy commuting Team culture with regular events (summer party, Christmas party, after-work meetups) and retreats Modern setup and laptops (Apple or Windows) Employee discounts on PERGOLUX products 📍 Office Location – Schlesische Str. 27 C, Building C, 6th floor, 10997 Berlin How to Apply Sounds like you? We'd love to receive your application. Find out more about us and open roles on our Career Page and on LinkedIn. PERGOLUX is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds, we think it's less about ticking every box and more about what you bring to the table! Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "Full Time" ;
