    schema:description "Your mission Independently managing the day-to-day financial accounting for our property companies and holding companies Preparing monthly, quarterly and annual financial statements in accordance with the German Commercial Code (HGB) and Luxembourg GAAP Preparing and submitting VAT returns on time Acting as the point of contact for internal and external stakeholders Preparing the annual tax documentation for the tax advisers Supporting the optimisation of financial processes and systems Contributing to diverse and exciting projects in the finance department, where you can bring your ideas and specialist knowledge to bear Your profile A degree in a business-related subject specialising in accounting, or a commercial apprenticeship with more than three years’ professional experience; further training, e.g. as a chartered accountant, would be an advantage In-depth knowledge of standard accounting software, ideally DATEV or Business Central A passion for working in a dynamic environment and the ability to maintain an overview even when dealing with a wide range of tasks A strong aptitude for numbers and the ability to quickly grasp interrelationships A conscientious, structured and results-oriented approach to work The ability to work efficiently both independently and as part of a team Good knowledge of MS Office, particularly Excel Fluency in spoken and written German at C2 level and English at B2 level Why us? A growing company with flat hierarchies A wide range of opportunities to shape your role and take on responsibility A dedicated and motivated team Opportunities for further training and development An attractive remuneration package, including a company pension contribution exceeding statutory requirements Flexible working hours Opportunities to keep fit with Urban Sports Club A high-quality working environment in modern offices Notes regarding your application We look forward to receiving your application! Please fill out our online application form and upload your complete application documents. We will send you a confirmation once we have received your documents. Please understand that we can only accept your application via the online form! Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
