    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">As a member of the&nbsp;ShipBob&nbsp;Team, you will...</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Grow with an Ownership Mindset</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">:&nbsp;We champion continuous learning and innovation.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;take on real problems,&nbsp;create tangible&nbsp;solutions, and&nbsp;drive results that move the needle&nbsp;for&nbsp;ShipBob,&nbsp;our merchants, and for your own professional growth.&nbsp;If&nbsp;you're&nbsp;ready to do the most meaningful work of your career, this is the place.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Collaborate with Peers and Leaders Alike:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">At&nbsp;ShipBob,&nbsp;leaders are&nbsp;accessible;&nbsp;feedback flows in both directions, and&nbsp;everyone, regardless of their seniority or role, steps up to help when needed.&nbsp;We hold each other to&nbsp;high standards&nbsp;because we trust each other to meet them. That combination of transparency and mutual respect is what makes the work here feel worth doing.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Experience a High-Performance Culture and Clear Purpose:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">We are results-driven and&nbsp;clear about what that means: our&nbsp;goals are specific, accountability is shared, and every team member can see how their work connects to&nbsp;our mission. When we hit milestones, we celebrate them together. When we fall short, we learn and move forward.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> </ul></div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Location: </span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">United Kingdom. Ability to travel across EMEA. </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Role Description:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">The Senior International Sourcing &amp; SFN Manager will be ShipBob's first dedicated in-market resource for the international SFN network. The role combines end-to-end sourcing of new fulfillment nodes across UK, EMEA and AUS with ongoing performance management of established&nbsp;international partners - a combination that reflects the scale of the current network and the pace of growth required through 2027 and beyond.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">This is not a support role. The person in this seat owns the international partner lifecycle from initial market intelligence through operator qualification, commercial origination, contracting, onboarding, and ongoing performance management. They are the single point of contact for all international network activity and the primary in-market commercial presence representing ShipBob to operators, brokers, and landlords across the region. This role reports to the Sr. Director, Network Development.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What you’ll do:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Sourcing</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Own the UK, EMEA and AUS operator sourcing pipeline end to end from market intelligence and operator identification through Pre-Screen, Operator Assessment Scorecard completion, commercial origination, and contract execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Maintain a live operator pipeline and tracker in advance of forecasting indicators and unique building needs.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Complete due diligence on all international operator assessments with regional specific considerations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct in-market site visits at the point of sourcing as a competency and audit activity.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Drive cross-functional sourcing efforts and execute plans that align with business objectives.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ensure multi-thread options in all region activities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Drive commercial conversations with international operators through MSA negotiation and execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify and flag non-standard clauses and work with legal to resolve.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Confirm all contracts meet ShipBob ramp needs while maintaining commercial viability.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Own handover from sourcing to implementation.</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Partner Performance Management</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Own the ongoing operational relationship with all UK, EMEA and AU partner sites including SLA tracking, QBR preparation, and first line escalation for operational issues.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Work in close coordination with operations teams on partner improvements, productivity enhancement, and compliance with ShipBob’s operating standards.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Issue and manage performance improvements for underperforming partner sites.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct planned and unannounced site visits in line with risk profiles.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Deliver monthly network health reports covering all international nodes including certification and compliance status and partner profitability.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What you’ll bring to the table:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Minimum 7 years of experience in third-party logistics, fulfillment network management, real estate sourcing or directly related field within the UK and EU markets.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Deep familiarity with the UK and EU logistics and 3PL operator landscape.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven track record of managing complex commercial negotiations with logistics operators or landlords to successful outcomes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience managing partner or supplier performance against defined frameworks, with comfort issuing cure notices, running improvement plans, and making exit recommendations when necessary.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to assess current market dynamics and operator environment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">High commercial maturity with ability to hold position in negotiation, identify when a partner is exploiting ambiguity, and represent ShipBob’s commercial interests without requiring escalation to resolve standard issues.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Exceptional data and reporting discipline.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Willingness and ability to travel regularly across UK, EU and AU for site visits and partner meetings.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">High EQ and interpersonal skills. An expert communicator who can span various stakeholder skillsets and backgrounds to clearly articulate needs to manage projects to successful outcomes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to thrive in a dynamic, high-growth environment and manage ambiguity.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong problem solving, analytical and project management skills, with ability to drive multiple projects simultaneously in complex situations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Excellent English communication, both written and oral.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Perks &amp; Benefits:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Medical and Wellness Benefits</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Life Assurance</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Income Protection</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Pension Scheme</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">See Our High-Performing Culture &gt;&gt;&gt;</span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lifeatshipbob/\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lifeatshipbob/\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">Check us out on Instagram</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"none\"> (@lifeatshipbob)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">#LI-AD1</span></span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\" lang=\"EN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\">We recognize that people come with a wealth of experience and talent beyond just the technical requirements of a job. If your experience is close to what you see listed here, please still consider applying. Diversity of experience and skills combined with passion is a key to innovation and excellence; therefore, we encourage people from all backgrounds to apply to our positions.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About You:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Building the world’s leading&nbsp;full-stack fulfillment platform&nbsp;is&nbsp;challenging&nbsp;work. The problems we solve are complex, the pace is fast, and the bar is high.&nbsp;That means&nbsp;ShipBob’s&nbsp;environment&nbsp;isn’t&nbsp;the right&nbsp;fit for everyone, and&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;okay.&nbsp;If you are ready to take ownership,&nbsp;push boundaries, and&nbsp;grow alongside a team that genuinely supports each other, we would love to hear from you.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Learn more about our core values and how we perform at a high level in our day-to-day work on our Culture page (</span><a href=\"https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"none\">).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\" lang=\"EN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\">About Us: </span></span>&nbsp;</strong><br class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"></span></span></p> <p><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW177749497 BCX0\" lang=\"EN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\">ShipBob is a leading global supply chain and fulfillment technology platform designed for SMB and Mid-Market ecommerce merchants to provide them access to best-in-class capabilities and to deliver a delightful shopper experience. Merchants can outsource their entire fulfillment operations, utilize </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0\">ShipBob’s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\"> proprietary warehouse management system for in-house fulfillment, or take advantage of a hybrid solution across </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0\">ShipBob’s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\"> dozens of fulfillment center network in the United States, Canada, United Kingdom, Europe, and Australia. </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0\">ShipBob</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0\"> is backed by leading investors like Menlo Ventures, Bain Capital Ventures, Hyde Park Venture Partners, and SoftBank Vision Fund 2, and is one of the fastest-growing tech companies headquartered in Chicago.</span></span>&nbsp;<br class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"></span></span></p> <p><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"><span data-teams=\"true\">At ShipBob, every full-time employee gets access to our best-in-class AI and productivity tools from Day 1 at no cost. This isn't a pilot or a perk for select teams. It's standard for everyone. We believe innovation isn't owned by one department. Whether you're in Talent, Operations, Finance, Engineering, or Customer Success, we expect you to ask: <em>how can this be done better, faster, or smarter?</em> These tools are our investment in your ability to find those answers.</span></span></span></p> <p><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"><span data-teams=\"true\"><strong>Use of AI-Assisted Tools During Recruitment</strong></span></span></span></p> <p></p> <p>We may use AI-assisted tools during the recruitment process to support administrative functions such as transcribing interviews, generating summaries or notes, organizing interview feedback, facilitating candidate communications, and helping recruiters identify candidates whose qualifications may align with job requirements. These tools are designed to assist our recruiting team and are not used to make final hiring decisions.&nbsp;Hiring decisions are made by trained human reviewers who consider the candidate's application, interview performance, qualifications, experience, and other relevant factors. AI-assisted tools do not independently determine whether a candidate advances in the hiring process or receives an offer of employment.&nbsp;Where required by applicable law, candidates will be provided with notice regarding our use of AI-assisted technologies and, where available, information about any applicable rights relating to such processing, including the ability to request additional information or opt out of certain AI-assisted processing activities. Candidates who exercise available opt-out rights may be reviewed through alternative processes consistent with applicable law.</p> <p><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"><em><span class=\"TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0\">ShipBob provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW263457653 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW263457653 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW263457653 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW263457653 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0\">This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0\">c</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0\">ompensation</span> <span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0\">and training.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></em></span></span></p> <p><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"SCXW177749497 BCX0\"><em><span class=\"EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\"><span data-teams=\"true\"><strong>There is no deadline to apply for this position, as ShipBob accepts applications on an ongoing basis</strong>.&nbsp;</span></span></em></span></span></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
