    schema:datePosted "2026-09-10"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Welcome&nbsp;to&nbsp;DKB&nbsp;AG….&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We’re&nbsp;excited to share that our hiring process is now led by Code Factory (CoFa), DKB’s sister tech company, bringing a more agile and collaborative approach to building our cross-functional teams. While&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;go through the hiring journey with&nbsp;CoFa, your employment will be with DKB, combining the stability of a leading bank with the speed and innovation of a tech-driven environment. Join us to be part of a team where collaboration and impact come first.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 4\">{&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 4\">your_responsibilities</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 4\">: [</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:319,&quot;335559739&quot;:319}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li>You will create test cases and test plans based on product requirements in an agile environment.</li> <li>You will ensure overall test readiness—including test infrastructure, test data, and environments—and actively drive test automation in both the front end and back end.</li> <li>You’ll plan and optimize testing processes and strategies as part of the team and serve as the primary point of contact for testing methods in an agile environment.</li> <li>You’ll support the teams in integrating “continuous testing” into CI/CD pipelines and oversee releases through to “go-live,” including the final test report.</li> <li>You’ll contribute to the further development of our QA strategy—including with regard to modern technologies such as AI-supported testing methods and test data generation.</li> <li>You’ll work closely with stakeholders to ensure quality across all system layers.</li> <li>You’ll coordinate continuously with internal DKB departments and external service providers.<span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">]&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">} ;</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">{ following_qualifications_would_be_in_line_with_our_desired_profile_for_this_position: [</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li>You have a college degree in a STEM field or comparable training with relevant professional experience.</li> <li>You have extensive experience in the software development process with a focus on software quality assurance and will take responsibility for test strategy, test design, and automation.</li> <li>Ideally, you hold an ISTQB certification.</li> <li>You communicate confidently with various stakeholders and can explain technical concepts clearly.</li> <li>You have experience in full-stack test automation using Serenity or Playwright.</li> <li>You confidently apply your programming skills in TypeScript or Java.</li> <li>Ideally, you have experience coordinating other QA engineers.</li> <li>You work in a structured, solution-oriented manner and actively contribute to the team’s continued development.</li> <li>Confident communication in&nbsp;<strong>German and English</strong>, ideally at <strong>B2 level or above</strong></li> </ul> <p><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 4\">] } ;</span></span></em></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:319,&quot;335559739&quot;:319}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">You&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;match every single requirement?&nbsp;No&nbsp;worries! We encourage you to apply anyways, even if your qualifications do not align perfectly. You might still be just the right candidate for us!</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">{ {&nbsp;…how_to_start_your_career_at_DKB:&nbsp;[</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We want you to feel good about working with us, to feel valued, and to be able to contribute fully.&nbsp;You can find out what makes us tick and whether DKB is the right employer for you even before you apply&nbsp;by following&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.dkb.de/karriere/arbeitgeber#unternehmenskultur\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">this link</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"none\">.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">}&nbsp;} ;</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.dkbcodefactory.com/images/benefits_dkbag.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"807\"></span></span></p> <p><em>By the way: At our company, every person matters. We embrace fairness and diversity—no matter where you’re from, how old you are, or your sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, or religion, whether you have a disability or not—we genuinely look forward to every application!</em></p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
