    schema:datePosted "2026-09-10"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<p>WongDoody –&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;over 2,000 colleagues across 22 design studios on four continents. In Germany, around 300 colleagues work with us at our locations in Berlin, Stuttgart, Düsseldorf, and remotely. Our service areas include Experience Design, Immersive Experiences, Influencer Marketing, and future-proof, holistic Digital Marketing. As part of Infosys, a global technology leader, we develop customer-centric solutions at the intersection of creativity, technology, and artificial intelligence.</p><p>We combine deep industry&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;in FMCG, retail, automotive, mechanical engineering, and technology. For brands such as dm, Otto, Porsche, Bosch, TRUMPF, and Mercedes-Benz, we create user-centric strategies, distinctive brand presences, digital products, and influencer campaigns that seamlessly integrate creativity, data, and media.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Our&nbsp;local&nbsp;benefits</strong></p><ul><li>Flexible&nbsp;working&nbsp;hours&nbsp;and 100%&nbsp;overtime&nbsp;compensation</li><li>Work&nbsp;where&nbsp;it&nbsp;works&nbsp;for&nbsp;you. At&nbsp;home&nbsp;or&nbsp;in the&nbsp;office,&nbsp;or&nbsp;any&nbsp;mix&nbsp;you&nbsp;like</li><li>Working for strong&nbsp;brands&nbsp;and&nbsp;clients&nbsp;we&nbsp;believe&nbsp;in</li><li>Urban Sports Club</li><li>Company Benefits</li><li>Nice&nbsp;people&nbsp;in&nbsp;welcoming&nbsp;teams</li></ul><p><strong>What&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;expect</strong></p><ul><li>This role offers the opportunity to&nbsp;turn&nbsp;your passion for social media into creating content for one of the world's best-known entertainment brands.</li><li>You’ll be part of a supportive team, work on varied and exciting content, and learn how social media communication for international brands works, from idea to published post. </li><li>You´ll support the team in developing ideas and concepts for social media content.</li><li>Write first drafts of copy for captions, posts, and short social formats</li><li>Take part in creative brainstorming sessions</li><li>Collaborate with copywriters, designers, motion designers, and social media managers</li><li>be up-to-date and close to&nbsp;social media trends, formats, and cultural moments </li><li>Learn how social content is created, reviewed, and published </li></ul><p><strong>What&nbsp;we’d&nbsp;love&nbsp;to&nbsp;see</strong></p><ul><li>Strong interest in social media, writing, and digital creativity </li><li>Good feeling for language, tone of voice, and platform-native writing </li><li>Interest in&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;different&nbsp;brand&nbsp;voices&nbsp;and social&nbsp;presences </li><li>Curiosity and&nbsp;motivation&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn </li><li>Creative&nbsp;mindset&nbsp;and&nbsp;willingness&nbsp;to&nbsp;share&nbsp;ideas </li><li>Reliable and&nbsp;organized&nbsp;working&nbsp;style </li><li>Team&nbsp;spirit&nbsp;and&nbsp;openness&nbsp;to&nbsp;collaboration </li><li>Currently&nbsp;enrolled&nbsp;as a&nbsp;student&nbsp;(Werkstudent&nbsp;status),&nbsp;available&nbsp;around&nbsp;15–20&nbsp;hours&nbsp;per&nbsp;week&nbsp;alongside&nbsp;your&nbsp;studies.</li><li>Fluent German&nbsp;is required; English&nbsp;is&nbsp;a strong plus </li><li>First&nbsp;writing&nbsp;samples, social&nbsp;posts,&nbsp;or&nbsp;creative&nbsp;projects&nbsp;are&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;but not required </li></ul><p>We&nbsp;care&nbsp;about&nbsp;your&nbsp;personality&nbsp;and professional&nbsp;skills.&nbsp;We&nbsp;don't&nbsp;care&nbsp;about&nbsp;your&nbsp;gender,&nbsp;age,&nbsp;nationality&nbsp;or&nbsp;appearance&nbsp;and&nbsp;are&nbsp;open to&nbsp;working&nbsp;with&nbsp;everyone.&nbsp;</p><p>Please&nbsp;note: This&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;job&nbsp;ad by&nbsp;WongDoody&nbsp;GmbH&nbsp;based&nbsp;in Germany. Through&nbsp;our&nbsp;website&nbsp;or&nbsp;other&nbsp;sources,&nbsp;you&nbsp;may&nbsp;find&nbsp;job&nbsp;ads&nbsp;published&nbsp;by&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;WongDoody&nbsp;sister&nbsp;companiesaround&nbsp;the&nbsp;globe&nbsp;with&nbsp;whom&nbsp;we&nbsp;act&nbsp;jointly&nbsp;under&nbsp;the band “WongDoody”. For&nbsp;each&nbsp;job&nbsp;offer,&nbsp;only&nbsp;the&nbsp;entity&nbsp;is&nbsp;responsible,&nbsp;which&nbsp;has&nbsp;published&nbsp;the ad. Contact&nbsp;persons,&nbsp;required&nbsp;informationand&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;terms&nbsp;may&nbsp;differ.&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;inform&nbsp;yourself&nbsp;how&nbsp;WongDoody&nbsp;GmbH&nbsp;is&nbsp;processing&nbsp;your&nbsp;personal&nbsp;data&nbsp;provided&nbsp;in ----- Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
